{"title":"2017 BMO","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>2017 BMO</b> problems and solutions. The 34th BMO was held in Ohrid, Former Yugoslav Republic of Macedonia on 2-7 May 2017.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_BMO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 BMO Problems (page does not exist)\">2017 BMO Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_BMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 BMO Problems/Problem 1 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_BMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 BMO Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_BMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 BMO Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_BMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 BMO Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 4</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"Balkan Mathematical Olympiad\">Balkan Mathematical Olympiad</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_MO_Problems_and_Solutions,_with_authors\" title=\"Balkan MO Problems and Solutions, with authors\">Balkan MO Problems and Solutions, with authors</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions\">Mathematics competitions</a><